flowchart TB
  A1[40 bots need something] --> A2[One shared ask queue]
  A2 --> A3{Already answered, or a<br/>standing approval covers it?}
  A3 -->|yes| A7[Bot does the work]
  A3 -->|no| A4{Can the judge cite a<br/>past founder answer?}
  A4 -->|yes, and it is internal<br/>and reversible| A7
  A4 -->|badly framed question| A8[Sent back to the bot]
  A4 -->|new judgment, or a send,<br/>spend, publish or delete| A5[One yes line to the founder]
  A5 --> A7
  A7 --> A6[Every call logged and<br/>the judge scored against the founder]
